---
description: Trace each scoped argument to its theme, response, or explicit disposition.
args: { arguments: ScopedArgument[]; themes: ThemeCoverage[]; responses: ResponseDraft; docket: ConsultationDocket }
returns: string[]
---
For each argument ID, require at least one supported theme relation or an explicit out-of-scope disposition grounded in the consultation scope statement. Check minority positions and challenged theme IDs even if their volume is small. Record every uncovered argument with submission ID, exact concern and missing report section. Do not hide an omission by citing a broad theme title.
